<div class="mandarin-hanzi">谢谢</div>
<div class="mandarin-pinyin">xièxie</div>

''Meaning:'' thank you  
''Part of speech:'' interjection

!! In context
谢谢你帮我。 — Xièxie nǐ bāng wǒ. — Thank you for helping me.

!! Usage note
An expression of thanks, typically with a neutral second syllable. 谢谢你 (xièxie nǐ) explicitly thanks the addressee.
